ental & Social Impact Assessment (ESIA) of integrated area development at least three projects for the last ten years. 3. Experience working in the field of consulting services on topics related to sustainable city infrastructure, nature-based solutions, climate change, and/or biodiversity (experience in the fields of circular waste management, and sustainable landscape). 4. Experience in Indonesia and/or comparable urban contexts (Palembang city experience is an advantage)', 0, 'low', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2554748);
